\n```html\n<!-- archive.html -->  \n<form action="{{ url_for(\'archive\') }}" method="GET">  \n    <input type="text" name="search" placeholder="Search tips...">  \n    <button type="submit">Search</button>  \n</form>  \n```  \nKey Functionality:  \n- Uses `GET` request to pass search queries.  \n\nPseudocode:  \n```\nFUNCTION search()  \n    GET query FROM form  \n    CALL TipManager.search_tips(query)  \n        READ tips.txt  \n        IF query MATCHES content  \n            RETURN matching tips  \n    RENDER archive.html with results  \n```\nKey Libraries:  \n- `Flask` (form handling, dynamic rendering)  \n\nPseudocode:  \n```\nCLASS TipManager  \n    FUNCTION search_tips(query)  \n        RETURN tips WHERE title OR content CONTAINS query  \n    END FUNCTION  \nEND CLASS  \n\nFUNCTION archive()  \n    IF query PROVIDED  \n        tips = TipManager.search_tips(query)  \n    ELSE  \n        tips = TipManager.get_all_tips()  \n    RENDER archive.html WITH tips  \nEND FUNCTION  \n```\nKey Libraries:  \n- `Flask` (request handling)  \n\n---\n\n7. ', '|Case|:submit_feedback  \nPseudocode:  \n```python\nFUNCTION feedback()  \n    IF \'username\' NOT IN session  \n        REDIRECT to login()  \n    IF request.method == \'POST\'  \n        tip_date = request.form[\'tip_date\']  \n        feedback_text = request.form[\'feedback\']  \n        FeedbackManager.submit_feedback(session[\'username\'], tip_date, feedback_text)  \n        REDIRECT to main()  \n    ELSE  \n        current_tip = TipManager.get_current_tip()  \n        RENDER feedback.html WITH tip_date=current_tip[\'date\']  \n    ENDIF  \nEND FUNCTION  \n\n# FeedbackManager.submit_feedback()  \nFUNCTION submit_feedback(username, tip_date, feedback)  \n    APPEND feedback (username|tip_date|feedback) to feedback.txt  \n    RETURN True  \nEND FUNCTION  \n```  \nKey Functionality:  \n- Stores feedback in `feedback.txt` with pipe-separated values.  \n\nPseudocode:  \n```\nFUNCTION submit_feedback()  \n    GET username, tip_id, rating, comment FROM form  \n    CALL FeedbackManager.submit_feedback(username, tip_id, rating, comment)  \n        APPEND feedback to feedback.txt  \n    REDIRECT to dashboard  \n\n<feedback.html>  \n    FORM action="/submit_feedback"  \n        INPUT username, tip_id, rating, comment  \n        BUTTON submit  \n```\nKey Libraries:  \n- `Flask` (form handling, file I/O)  \n\nPseudocode:  \n```\nCLASS FeedbackManager  \n    FUNCTION submit_feedback(username, feedback)  \n        IF username OR feedback MISSING  \n            RETURN False  \n        APPEND feedback to feedback.txt  \n        RETURN True  \n    END FUNCTION  \nEND CLASS  \n\nFUNCTION feedback()  \n    IF request.method == \'POST\'  \n        IF FeedbackManager.submit_feedback(session[\'username\'], feedback)  \n            REDIRECT to dashboard  \n        ELSE  \n            RENDER feedback.html WITH error  \n    ELSE  \n        RENDER feedback.html  \nEND FUNCTION  \n```\nKey Libraries:  \n- `datetime` (timestamping feedback)  \n\n---\n\n8. |Case|:data_storage  \nPseudocode:  \n```python\n# All managers (UserManager, TipManager, FeedbackManager) use file-based storage:  \n- users.txt (username|password|email)  \n- tips.txt (date|content)  \n- feedback.txt (username|tip_date|feedback)  \n```  \nKey Functionality:  \n- Plaintext file storage (no encryption or database).  \n\nPseudocode:  \n```\nCLASS UserManager, TipManager, FeedbackManager  \n    INITIALIZE .txt files if not exist  \n    ALL operations READ/WRITE to files  \n```\nKey Libraries:  \n- `os` (file existence checks)  \n\nPseudocode:  \n```\nCLASS TipManager  \n    FUNCTION _load_tips()  \n        READ tips.txt  \n        PARSE into structured list  \n        RETURN tips  \n    END FUNCTION  \nEND CLASS  \n\nCLASS UserManager  \n    FUNCTION validate_user()  \n        READ users.txt  \n        CHECK credentials  \n    END FUNCTION  \nEND CLASS  \n```\nKey Libraries:  \n- `os` (file handling)  \n\n---\n\n9. ', '|Case|:logout  \nPse